{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>For Elohim has made me forget all my toil and all my father's house.</b> From here they said of a woman's father's house: בי נשא, meaning 'a house of forgetting,' after the verse (Genesis 2): ״על כן יעזב איש את אביו ואת אמו ודבק באשתו״ — therefore a man leaves his father and his mother and clings to his wife — and so too the woman to her husband."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:40.035832074Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}